  /* ---------- the back (spec v3 §2): positions are fractions of the card, type in --u ---------- */
  /* ground: the photograph's darkest colour in the card brown, a faint pool of its tone at the upper left;
     ink: its tone toward cream, so each card writes in its own colour */
